Lunacy's Sync Status.

The part of webOS's System UI (luna-systemui) that showed accounts syncing and being removed:
it hosts Enyo 1's SyncUI.syncDashboard (framework/lib/syncui), unchanged, as SystemUI's
SystemUIApp did on the reference TouchPad (webOS CE 3.1.0). It has no window of its own;
Lunacy starts it when an account's sync state calls for a dashboard, and it ends when the
last one goes.

The app's code is Lunacy's, under the same terms as the rest of Lunacy. Its banners,
dashboards, strings and icon are Enyo's syncui library's, which ships with Lunacy's Enyo
(see its NOTICE). It carries no art of its own.
